{"sectionId":"bonding/lewis","items":[{"id":"bonding--lewis-k001","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"Lewis 구조는 원자가전자를 결합과 비공유전자쌍으로 표현한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--lewis-k002","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"형식전하 FC=원자가전자 수−비공유전자 수−결합전자 수/2이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--lewis-k003","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"공명 구조는 원자의 배치를 유지하면서 전자 배치만 바꾼 표현이며 실제 구조는 공명 혼성체다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--lewis-k004","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"2주기 중심원소는 보통 옥텟을 넘지 못하며 BF₃ 등의 전자 부족, NO 등의 홀전자 예외가 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--lewis-k005","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"3주기 이후 초원자가 구조를 단순 d 혼성만으로 설명하는 것은 현대 결합 모형의 한계가 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--lewis-k006","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"VSEPR에서 전자영역 수 2,3,4,5,6에 따른 기본 기하는 선형, 평면삼각, 정사면체, 삼각쌍뿔, 팔면체다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--lewis-k007","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"비공유전자쌍은 결합각에 영향을 준다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--lewis-k008","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"CH₄는 정사면체, NH₃는 삼각뿔, H₂O는 굽은형, SF₄는 seesaw, ClF₃는 T형, XeF₄는 평면사각형이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--lewis-k009","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"sp/sp²/sp³ 모형은 각각 선형/평면삼각/정사면체의 국소 결합에 유용하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--lewis-k010","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"이중결합은 σ 하나와 π 하나, 삼중결합은 σ 하나와 π 두 개를 포함한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--lewis-k011","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"FC의 합은 분자 또는 이온의 전체 전하.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--lewis-k012","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"다중결합은 VSEPR에서 하나의 전자영역으로 센다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--lewis-k013","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"CO₂는 결합 쌍극자가 상쇄되어 비극성이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--lewis-k014","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"공명은 구조가 시간에 따라 왕복하는 현상이 아니다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--lewis-k015","sectionId":"bonding/lewis","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"4개, 정사면체이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}